{"id": "b70273fb-7438-4ee7-b12f-feed4172ba9e", "slug": "system-throughput-metrics", "title": "System Throughput Metrics", "description": "System Throughput UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"System Throughput Metrics\"\ndescription: \"System Throughput UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#0A0A0A\"\n  secondary: \"#050505\"\n  accent: \"#0A0A0A\"\n  background: \"#0A0A0A\"\n  surface: \"#171717\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"15px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# System Throughput Metrics\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 10; favorites: 3; remixes: 0.\nTags: dashboard, charts, bento, animated, webgl, threejs, dither, flow.\n## Overview\nSystem Throughput UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\n01_TRX 02_CORE 03_BND System Bandwidth 842.10P +12.45% ALL-TIME 840.20P +12.45% (+9.1P) T4 Baseline T4 Baseline\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: 842.10P.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #0A0A0A, secondary #050505, accent #0A0A0A, background #0A0A0A, surface #171717, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>System Throughput Metrics</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@200;300;400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"min-h-[100dvh] flex items-center justify-center p-4 sm:p-8 text-neutral-300 overflow-hidden antialiased font-light\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: #0a0a0a; background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% -20%, #171717 0%, #0a0a0a 70%);\">\n\n    <!-- ASCII Dither Background -->\n    <div data-ascii-dither-bg aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;bottom:auto;height:100vh;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;overflow:hidden\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Container Lines & Framing -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-2xl aspect-square mx-auto group\">\n\n        <!-- Left Container Line -->\n        <div class=\"absolute -left-6 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-neutral-800/80 gsap-line origin-top hidden sm:block\">\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-px -left-px w-[3px] h-[3px] bg-neutral-500\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-px -left-px w-[3px] h-[3px] bg-neutral-500\"></div>\n            <!-- Number Detail 01 -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-8 -left-5 -rotate-90 text-xs text-neutral-500 tracking-widest gsap-fade\">01_TRX</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right Container Line -->\n        <div class=\"absolute -right-6 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-neutral-800/80 gsap-line origin-top hidden sm:block\">\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-px -left-px w-[3px] h-[3px] bg-neutral-500\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-px -left-px w-[3px] h-[3px] bg-neutral-500\"></div>\n            <!-- Number Detail 02 -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 -right-5 -rotate-90 text-xs text-neutral-500 tracking-widest gsap-fade\">02_CORE</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Premium Border Gradient Substrate -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-neutral-600/30 via-neutral-900/50 to-neutral-400/20 gsap-fade\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n\n            <!-- Inner Panel -->\n            <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#050505] rounded-[15px] relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col border border-white/5 shadow-2xl\">\n\n                <!-- Number Detail 03 (Inner) -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-6 right-6 text-xs text-neutral-600 tracking-widest pointer-events-none gsap-fade\">03_BND</div>\n\n                <!-- Top Header Section -->\n                <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start gap-4 p-6 sm:p-10 pointer-events-none\">\n                    <div class=\"pointer-events-auto gsap-fade\">\n                        <div class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 tracking-widest font-light mb-2 uppercase\">System Bandwidth</div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-3 sm:gap-4\">\n                            <h1 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-thin tracking-tight text-white\">842.10P</h1>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-light text-neutral-300 tracking-wide\">+12.45%</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Custom Dropdown Component -->\n                    <button class=\"pointer-events-auto flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded bg-neutral-900/80 border border-neutral-700/60 text-xs font-light text-neutral-400 hover:bg-neutral-800/80 hover:text-white transition-all backdrop-blur-sm gsap-fade\">\n                        ALL-TIME\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:slider-vertical-1-linear\" class=\"text-sm opacity-80\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5px;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- WebGL Chart Area -->\n                <div class=\"relative flex-1 w-full mt-[-10px] sm:mt-[-20px] overflow-hidden gsap-fade\">\n                    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full cursor-crosshair opacity-90\"></canvas>\n\n                    <!-- Dynamic HTML Overlay: Tooltip tracking 3D point -->\n                    <div id=\"data-tooltip\" class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 pointer-events-none opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 ease-in-out z-20\" style=\"transform: translate(16px, -100%);\">\n                        <!-- Connecting Line -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-[-30px] left-[-16px] w-px h-[30px] bg-gradient-to-t from-transparent to-neutral-400\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Tooltip Card -->\n                        <div class=\"border border-neutral-700 bg-[#050505]/95 backdrop-blur-md pl-4 pr-6 py-3 rounded relative shadow-lg\">\n                            <!-- Tech Corner Accents -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 border-t border-l border-white/60\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 border-b border-r border-white/60\"></div>\n\n                            <div class=\"text-white font-light text-sm mb-0.5 tracking-wide\" id=\"tooltip-val\">840.20P</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-neutral-300 font-thin mb-1.5 text-xs\">+12.45% <span class=\"text-neutral-500 ml-1\">(+9.1P)</span></div>\n                            <div class=\"text-neutral-500 text-xs tracking-wide uppercase\">T4 Baseline</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- X-Axis Label -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-6 right-10 text-xs font-light text-neutral-600 tracking-widest uppercase pointer-events-none\">T4 Baseline</div>\n\n                    <!-- Subtle Horizontal Baseline -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-12 left-10 right-10 border-b border-dashed border-neutral-800/80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Future Industrial UI Accents -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-32 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/30 to-transparent\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex items-center gap-1 opacity-60\">\n                    <div class=\"w-6 h-px bg-neutral-600\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-1 h-[3px] bg-white\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-6 h-px bg-neutral-600\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- ASCII Dither Script -->\n    <script src=\"https://api.asc11.com/storage/v1/object/public/published-scripts/exports/20260311130629322-7efd7ec3-20260311125908409-9cd61b31-ascii-dither-background.js\"></script>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            // GSAP Entrance Animations\n            gsap.from(\".gsap-fade\", { y: 15, opacity: 0, duration: 1.2, stagger: 0.1, ease: \"power2.out\", delay: 0.1 });\n            gsap.from(\".gsap-line\", { scaleY: 0, duration: 1.5, ease: \"power3.inOut\" });\n\n            // WebGL Setup\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n            const tooltip = document.getElementById('data-tooltip');\n            const tooltipVal = document.getElementById('tooltip-val');\n\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-10, 10, 5, -5, 0.1, 100);\n            camera.position.z = 10;\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n            // Base Data Points\n            const dataPoints = [\n                [-9, -1.0], [-8, -1.1], [-7, -1.2], [-6, -1.5], [-5.5, -1.4], [-5, -2.0],\n                [-4, -1.8], [-3.5, -2.2], [-3, -2.0], [-2.5, -2.5], [-2, -2.3], [-1.5, -2.8],\n                [-1, -2.6], [-0.5, -1.0], [0, -1.2], [0.5, -0.5], [1, -0.6], [1.5, -0.2],\n                [2, -0.4], [2.5, 0.0], [3, -0.2], [3.5, -0.2], [4, -0.1], [4.5, -0.2],\n                [5, 0.2], [5.5, 2.8], [6, 0.4], [6.5, 0.4], [7, 2.2], [7.5, -0.1],\n                [8, 0.0], [8.5, -0.5], [9, 0.2], [9.5, -0.1]\n            ];\n            const vectors = dataPoints.map(p => new THREE.Vector3(p[0], p[1], 0));\n            const topCurve = new THREE.CatmullRomCurve3(vectors);\n\n            // Generate Topography Lines\n            const lines = [];\n            const numLines = 6;\n            const lineGroup = new THREE.Group();\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < numLines; i++) {\n                const offsetVectors = vectors.map(v => new THREE.Vector3(v.x, v.y - (i * 0.45), v.z - (i * 0.8)));\n                const curve = new THREE.CatmullRomCurve3(offsetVectors);\n                curve.tension = 0.5;\n                const points = curve.getPoints(250);\n                const geometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints(points);\n\n                const material = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({\n                    color: 0xffffff,\n                    transparent: true,\n                    opacity: Math.max(0.1, 0.8 - (i * 0.15)),\n                    blending: THREE.NormalBlending\n                });\n\n                const line = new THREE.Line(geometry, material);\n                lineGroup.add(line);\n                lines.push({ mesh: line, index: i, basePoints: points });\n            }\n            scene.add(lineGroup);\n\n            // Active Point Indicator\n            const pointGroup = new THREE.Group();\n            const sphereGeo = new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.08, 16, 16);\n            const sphereMat = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: 0xffffff });\n            const sphere = new THREE.Mesh(sphereGeo, sphereMat);\n            pointGroup.add(sphere);\n            scene.add(pointGroup);\n\n            // Interaction Variables\n            let targetProgress = 0.8;\n            let currentProgress = 0.8;\n            let isHovering = false;\n            let mouseX = -100;\n\n            canvas.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                isHovering = true;\n                const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const x = (e.clientX - rect.left) / rect.width;\n                targetProgress = Math.max(0.02, Math.min(0.98, x));\n\n                // Map mouse for wave attraction\n                mouseX = (e.clientX - rect.left) / rect.width * 20 - 10;\n            });\n\n            canvas.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n                isHovering = false;\n                targetProgress = 0.8;\n                mouseX = -100;\n            });\n\n            // Resize & Camera\n            function resize() {\n                const width = canvas.clientWidth;\n                const height = canvas.clientHeight;\n                renderer.setSize(width, height, false);\n                const aspect = width / height;\n                const frustumHeight = 12;\n                const frustumWidth = frustumHeight * aspect;\n\n                camera.left = -frustumWidth / 2;\n                camera.right = frustumWidth / 2;\n                camera.top = frustumHeight / 2;\n                camera.bottom = -frustumHeight / 2;\n                camera.position.x = 1;\n                camera.position.y = -1.5;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n            }\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n            resize();\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n            function animate() {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                const time = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                // Smooth follow for point progress\n                currentProgress += (targetProgress - currentProgress) * 0.08;\n                const activePos = topCurve.getPoint(currentProgress);\n\n                // Dynamic Loop & Magnetic Attraction\n                lines.forEach((lineData) => {\n                    const positions = lineData.mesh.geometry.attributes.position;\n                    for(let i = 0; i < positions.count; i++) {\n                        const x = lineData.basePoints[i].x;\n                        const baseY = lineData.basePoints[i].y;\n\n                        // Base looping wave animation\n                        let y = baseY + Math.sin(time * 1.5 + x * 0.6) * 0.15;\n\n                        // Magnetic attract on hover\n                        if(isHovering) {\n                            const distX = Math.abs(x - mouseX);\n                            if(distX < 2.5) {\n                                const pull = (2.5 - distX) * 0.25;\n                                y += pull * (lineData.index === 0 ? 1 : 0.4);\n                            }\n                        }\n                        positions.setY(i, y);\n                    }\n                    positions.needsUpdate = true;\n                });\n\n                // Bind dot position to the dynamic top line\n                const pointIdx = Math.max(0, Math.min(249, Math.floor(currentProgress * 250)));\n                const dynamicY = lines[0].mesh.geometry.attributes.position.getY(pointIdx);\n                pointGroup.position.set(activePos.x, dynamicY, activePos.z);\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n\n                // Update Tooltip Position & Data\n                const vector = pointGroup.position.clone();\n                vector.project(camera);\n                const screenX = (vector.x * 0.5 + 0.5) * canvas.clientWidth;\n                const screenY = (-(vector.y * 0.5) + 0.5) * canvas.clientHeight;\n\n                tooltip.style.left = `${screenX}px`;\n                tooltip.style.top = `${screenY}px`;\n\n                if (tooltip.style.opacity === \"0\") {\n                    setTimeout(() => { tooltip.style.opacity = \"1\"; }, 600);\n                }\n\n                // Simulate data update\n                if(isHovering) {\n                    const simVal = (750 + (currentProgress * 115)).toFixed(2);\n                    tooltipVal.innerText = `${simVal}P`;\n                } else {\n                    tooltipVal.innerText = `842.10P`;\n                }\n            }\n\n            animate();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "system-throughput-metrics.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/system-throughput-metrics.jpg", "source_name": "system-throughput-metrics-DESIGN.md", "views": 61, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T20:30:36.960849+00:00"}